WEBVTT

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<u>I  LOVE  ANIME</u>

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
STUDIO  RIVA - Nyo

00:02.410 --> 00:07.920
<b>#ILA @ Rizon</b>

00:06.220 --> 00:12.920
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakeru made</b>

00:13.500 --> 00:19.260
<b>Ichinichi mainichi wo tanoshiku ikite</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:24.770
<b>Totsuzen umarekuru setsuna no fuan</b>

00:25.280 --> 00:31.370
<b>2000-nen mondai yori
jibun no yume</b>

00:31.480 --> 00:37.350
<b>Sekai de ichiban kagayakitai</b>

00:37.450 --> 00:40.420
<b>Omoi wa number 1 star</b>

00:40.520 --> 00:43.490
<b>Kono sora no naka de</b>

00:48.980 --> 00:51.470
<b>I shouldn't have stayed out so late.</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:54.920
<b>Sign : Space</b>

00:51.590 --> 00:54.920
<b>I'm so hungry.
I can't wait till I get home.</b>

00:55.020 --> 00:56.490
<b>Hey, wait!</b>

00:58.090 --> 01:00.750
<b>I'm glad I brought some
melon bread with me.</b>

01:01.330 --> 01:03.020
<b>No!</b>

01:03.130 --> 01:04.530
<b>Who are you!?</b>

01:06.600 --> 01:09.500
<b>Nyon, nyon, nyon.
I ate it, nyon.</b>

01:09.600 --> 01:11.000
<b>What!?</b>

01:11.110 --> 01:13.940
<b>My... my melon bread's gone.
Nyon, nyon, nyon.</b>

01:14.610 --> 01:17.700
<b>Those were cat ears.</b>

01:17.810 --> 01:19.780
<b>And I heard the sound of a bell.</b>

01:20.350 --> 01:23.410
<b>So that's what happened last night.
Oooh, my melon bread.</b>

01:23.520 --> 01:25.140
<b>The thief must be Dejiko.</b>

01:25.250 --> 01:25.910
<b>What nyo?</b>

01:26.020 --> 01:28.850
<b>Because the thief had cat ears
and there was a sound of a bell,</b>

01:28.960 --> 01:30.420
<b>so it has to be Dejiko.</b>

01:30.520 --> 01:31.890
<b>You did it nyu?
Nyoooo.</b>

01:31.990 --> 01:33.190
<b>Is that the truth gema?</b>

01:33.290 --> 01:35.160
<b>You're wrong nyo.
It wasn't me nyo!</b>

01:35.260 --> 01:38.030
<b>That's it! The thief kept saying
''nyo nyo nyo nyo.''</b>

01:38.130 --> 01:39.530
<b>Then it's definitely her.</b>

01:39.630 --> 01:41.100
<b>Dejiko-chan, say it's not true?</b>

01:41.200 --> 01:43.230
<b>Is it true?
It can't be, right? But is it?</b>

01:43.340 --> 01:44.860
<b>You're wrong nyo.
You're all wrong nyo.</b>

01:44.970 --> 01:47.270
<b>I wouldn't do anything that bad nyo!</b>

01:48.510 --> 01:50.500
<b>Will you listen to my story?</b>

01:50.610 --> 01:53.010
<b>You have a story, too nyo?</b>

01:53.110 --> 01:54.080
<b>Listen.</b>

01:54.480 --> 01:59.550
<b>Sign : Akihabara Station</b>

01:54.480 --> 01:59.550
<b>I went to an all-you-can-eat buffet
and ate way too much.</b>

02:03.160 --> 02:07.060
<b>Oh no! I need a toilet!
My stomach's killing me.</b>

02:07.160 --> 02:10.320
<b>I need to find a bathroom
before my bowels explode.</b>

02:12.670 --> 02:14.260
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

02:25.250 --> 02:27.310
<b>So that's what happened,
Puchiko-chan.</b>

02:27.420 --> 02:28.880
<b>Did you poop your pants nyu?</b>

02:28.980 --> 02:31.850
<b>You were pretty busy
causing trouble last night, Dejiko.</b>

02:31.950 --> 02:35.120
<b>Y-You're wrong nyo.
Why are you looking at me like that nyo?</b>

02:35.220 --> 02:36.590
<b>I didn't do it nyo!</b>

02:36.690 --> 02:38.160
<b>Just confess gema.</b>

02:38.260 --> 02:40.750
<b>It's okay. I'm not mad about
the melon bread, Dejiko-chan.</b>

02:40.860 --> 02:43.630
<b>You're all wrong nyo.
It wasn't me nyo.</b>

02:43.730 --> 02:45.960
<b>I was so tired last night...</b>

02:46.070 --> 02:49.300
<b>that I fell asleep as soon
as I got back to the room gema.</b>

02:49.400 --> 02:51.770
<b>I didn't even notice that
Dejiko was gone gema.</b>

02:51.870 --> 02:56.370
<b>I was taking a bath, so I don't know
where Dejiko went last night nyu.</b>

02:57.680 --> 02:59.840
<b>I told you, I didn't do it nyo!</b>

02:59.950 --> 03:02.280
<b>We caught you.Just confess.</b>

03:02.380 --> 03:07.840
<b>I'm sorry that I let the manju
that I couldn't finish mold nyo!</b>

03:07.960 --> 03:10.450
<b>We'll bring you food in prison,
Dejiko-chan.</b>

03:10.560 --> 03:13.930
<b>We'll write to you,
so don't get lonely, Dejiko-chan.</b>

03:14.830 --> 03:18.060
<b>I know how I can get you
to believe me nyo!</b>

03:18.470 --> 03:21.700
<b>What if I give you some
''Di Gi Candy?''</b>

03:21.800 --> 03:23.270
<b>Will you believe me then nyo?</b>

03:23.370 --> 03:24.430
<b>That's bribery gema!</b>

03:24.540 --> 03:27.170
<b> Sign : Di Gi Candy</b>

03:24.540 --> 03:27.170
<b>Di Gi Candy
I'll share it with all of you nyo.</b>

03:27.270 --> 03:28.570
<b>Nyo?</b>

03:34.580 --> 03:36.310
<b>I ate it all nyon!</b>

03:37.820 --> 03:40.180
<b>Sign : This is Akihabara</b>

03:37.820 --> 03:40.180
<b>So that's the culprit!</b>

03:41.120 --> 03:44.090
<b>Remember,
there's only one Dejiko nyo!</b>
